1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,857
Five thousand two hundred and nine lasts.

2
00:00:02,917 --> 00:00:05,981
Every shoe Sanghavi makes
starts on one of them.

3
00:00:11,891 --> 00:00:13,210
Describe the shoe.

4
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:16,583
Cole Haan, gents, size
forty-two, round toe.

5
00:00:16,643 --> 00:00:20,168
Forma reads the sentence
and sets the filters.

6
00:00:22,118 --> 00:00:27,363
That returns a hundred lasts, and every
one of them reads a hundred percent.

7
00:00:27,423 --> 00:00:29,517
A name is not a specification.

8
00:00:31,664 --> 00:00:32,943
So give it numbers.

9
00:00:33,003 --> 00:00:34,987
Stick length two eighty-five.

10
00:00:35,047 --> 00:00:36,468
Ball girth two fifty.

11
00:00:36,528 --> 00:00:37,938
Heel height fifteen.

12
00:00:39,845 --> 00:00:41,648
Now the archive separates.

13
00:00:41,708 --> 00:00:45,861
Forma ranks by the cost of the
rework, not by resemblance.

14
00:00:48,027 --> 00:00:49,489
Here is your base last.

15
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:54,444
Ninety-eight point nine percent, and
seven tenths of a millimetre of work.

16
00:00:56,891 --> 00:00:58,855
Rasp one millimetre of girth.

17
00:00:58,915 --> 00:01:00,739
Grade up three point eight.

18
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:02,414
Putty half a millimetre.

19
00:01:02,474 --> 00:01:04,777
The modeller's own words, priced.

20
00:01:07,118 --> 00:01:10,350
Open it. Taped girths
beside the mesh estimate.

21
00:01:10,410 --> 00:01:14,612
Forty-six thousand triangles,
levelled to the contact plane.

22
00:01:16,664 --> 00:01:18,961
No spec sheet? Hand Forma the mesh.

23
00:01:19,021 --> 00:01:23,872
It measures your upload with the
instruments the archive was built with.

24
00:01:26,209 --> 00:01:31,153
I uploaded model five two five,
five one two, two seven five.

25
00:01:31,213 --> 00:01:34,084
Forma ranked that same model first.

26
00:01:36,436 --> 00:01:37,745
Now the harder ask.

27
00:01:37,805 --> 00:01:40,050
You have the sole, not the last.

28
00:01:40,110 --> 00:01:43,351
Forma reconstructs the
featherline it sat on.

29
00:01:45,982 --> 00:01:47,622
Flat outsole, detected.

30
00:01:47,682 --> 00:01:49,321
Inset by the allowance.

31
00:01:49,381 --> 00:01:52,929
First out of five thousand
two hundred and nine.

32
00:01:55,527 --> 00:01:58,017
The sole is the most important piece.

33
00:01:58,077 --> 00:02:02,211
Deform the donor, and Forma
keeps the bottom you matched on.

34
00:02:04,391 --> 00:02:06,445
Inventory, labeling, overview.

35
00:02:06,505 --> 00:02:10,380
Twelve lasts a page, one
locked view, turning together.

36
00:02:12,573 --> 00:02:14,988
Forma. Find the last you already own.
